Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}First guy into the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.14,0:00:02.72,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Olympic stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}The crowd goes wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Funny thing is, if
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.10,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his {\c&H006DDCFF&}car{\r} hadn't broken
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.10,0:00:08.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}down, he wouldn't even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}be fucking running.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.64,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Olympic marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Thirty-two starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Heat, dust, and Fred
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:19.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}Lorz{\r} gets cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.34,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}He drops out and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.82,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}catches a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Bad day for his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}legs. Tremendous day for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.84,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:28.09,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Then the {\c&H006DDCFF&}car{\r} breaks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}down. So Fred starts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:31.95,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:33.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Past the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Into the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:36.91,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}All those people see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.91,0:00:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}is the {\c&H006DDCFF&}finish{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:40.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Holy shit, this champion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:41.39,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}looks fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:43.53,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Of course he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.53,0:00:44.65,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}His ass handled the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.17,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.33,0:00:48.41,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Witnesses spotted the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.41,0:00:51.29,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}Lorz{\r} was disqualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:52.35,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Thomas {\c&H006DDCFF&}Hicks{\r} was the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:53.61,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}real winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.61,0:00:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}But check the photo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}after the {\c&H006DDCFF&}finish{\r}, {\c&H006DDCFF&}Hicks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.19,0:00:56.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}is sitting in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}{\c&H006DDCFF&}car{\r} too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:00.40,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Same damn idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.40,0:01:01.22,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}One got a ride
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}afterwards. The other was
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:05.18,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}a little early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.35,0:01:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}A year later {\c&H006DDCFF&}Lorz{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.51,0:01:08.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}won the Boston Marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.57,0:01:10.27,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}On foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:11.45,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}Imagine being that good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.45,0:01:12.31,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}at running, and a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.31,0:01:13.78,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}century later everyone remembers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs66}that time you were
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.73,0:01:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fs60}fucking magnificent at sitting down.
